	"data": "Module 8: Maintenance — Implementation Detail\n\nPart of the Custom RAG Pipeline. See custom-rag-pipeline.md for the full system map.\n\nOverview\n\nM8 is the caretaker — it keeps the pipeline healthy over time. Where M7 detects problems, M8 fixes them. The vault is a living document: files are created, edited, moved, and deleted daily. The Qdrant index must track these changes or the pipeline silently degrades.\n\nCore principle: M8 operations are safe by default. Nothing is deleted without…",
